    "detailed_description": "The Short Story Of A Riftkeeper is a short game about a Riftkeeper, one who is tasked to find and close any open doors in 'the Rifts' to prevent unwanted things from entering the universe.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThroughout a series of trips to 'the Rifts', the protagonist will slowly learn about himself and his background, and why he is doing what he is doing. With a voice coming from a radio as his only companion in this lonely job, he eventually has to face the truth of his story and accept the consequences.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Collect a variety of items such as torchlights to help you in your journey in the dimly-lit Rifts<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Explore the randomly generated Rifts to close doors, and get out before your sanity hits zero<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Experience short, story-driven levels before ending with an infinite randomly-generated Rifts for players to experience at their own leisure",
    "about_the_game": "The Short Story Of A Riftkeeper is a short game about a Riftkeeper, one who is tasked to find and close any open doors in 'the Rifts' to prevent unwanted things from entering the universe.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThroughout a series of trips to 'the Rifts', the protagonist will slowly learn about himself and his background, and why he is doing what he is doing. With a voice coming from a radio as his only companion in this lonely job, he eventually has to face the truth of his story and accept the consequences.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Collect a variety of items such as torchlights to help you in your journey in the dimly-lit Rifts<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Explore the randomly generated Rifts to close doors, and get out before your sanity hits zero<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Experience short, story-driven levels before ending with an infinite randomly-generated Rifts for players to experience at their own leisure",
